4. datetime: Used for timestamps, logs, scheduling, ETL Processing, date
calculations

1. datetime.now( ) : It return Current Date and time
2. date.today( ) : It return current Date
3. strftime( ) : Used to format date
4. strptime( ) : Used to convert string to date

from datetime import datetime,date
print(datetime.now())
print(date.today())
today=datetime.now()
print(today.strftime("13-06-2000"))
d = datetime.strptime("14-05-2026", "%d-%m-%Y")
print(d)

